# 行尾统一：仓库里存 LF，Windows 检出时转 CRLF（.rc/.sln/.reg 必须是 CRLF，
# rc.exe 和注册表编辑器对 LF 很敏感）。
* text=auto eol=crlf

# 源码统一 UTF-8，别让 Git 当成二进制或误判编码
*.cpp   text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.h     text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.inc   text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.rc    text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.ini   text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.md    text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.html  text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.py    text  working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.reg   text eol=crlf

# 二进制：别做换行/编码转换，也别在 diff 里当文本展开
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.txt   text

# 这个 2003 年的遗留文件是 GBK 编码（conv.cpp 会先按 UTF-8 试、失败再按 GBK 解），
# 必须原样入库，不能被编码转换或换行转换改坏。
# 注意：必须写在 *.txt 之后——Git 用最后一条匹配的规则。
Add-ons/gbkfix.txt -text
